    "Description": "In our Aura solitaire ring the central cushion-cut diamond is ensconced by a halo of micropavé diamonds. The delicate micropavé is inset by hand on the platinum band and around the central solitaire to ensure the contours of the diamond engagement ring are closely embraced. The cushion cut debuted in the 19th century. Yet it has endured across eras, and continues to speak to modern sentiments – making it an ideal choice as a token of lasting commitment. Our diamond engagement rings are also available through our bespoke service, For You, Forever. This offering invites the wearer to choose a diamond, and select a setting, allowing De Beers’ team of craftspeople to tailor-make a truly unique piece.",
